  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kabul Municipal Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The Project Development Objectives are to: (i)	Increase access to basic municipal services in selected residential areas of Kabul city; (ii)	Redesign KM&#x2019;s Financial Management system to support better service delivery; and (iii)	Enable early response in the event of an eligible emergency. &quot;</narrative>
  </description>
